# Mosquitto ACL primer za Smart Playgrounds
# Naloga: SCRUM-36
#
# Kopiraj v /mosquitto/config/acl in prilagodi uporabniska imena.
# Uporabniki se ustvarijo z mosquitto_passwd v datoteki passwd.

user npo-publisher
topic write smart-playgrounds/devices/+/sensors/+
topic write smart-playgrounds/devices/+/status/+
topic read smart-playgrounds/system/broker/status

user rai-consumer
topic read smart-playgrounds/devices/+/sensors/+
topic read smart-playgrounds/devices/+/status/#
topic write smart-playgrounds/analytics/#

user monitoring
topic read $SYS/#
topic write smart-playgrounds/system/broker/status

user web-dashboard
topic read smart-playgrounds/analytics/#
topic read smart-playgrounds/system/broker/status
